      "created_at": "2015-08-10T01:11:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><span>Hey all.&nbsp;</span><br><span>It seems odd.</span><br><br><span>I go to attach the figures to their bases....</span><br><span>but the holes drilled for them appear to be larger on one side than the other (albeit slightly).</span><br><br><span>They don't seem to stay or fit in the drilled holes well.. and on the side they do.... the name of the base is upside down.</span><br><br><span>Are we expected to glue them in ?</span><br><br><span>any advice is appreciated.</span><br><br><span>Thanks,</span><br><span>runatyr</span></p>",
