      "created_at": "2015-08-10T15:36:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I've glued mine. The only reason you might not want to&nbsp;<span>(that I can think of)&nbsp;</span><span>is if you haven't painted them but plan to.&nbsp;</span></p><p>But use the glue sparingly! It doesn't take much, and it's really easy to mark up the clear bases if we use too much...</p>",
